{"labs": [{"_data": [{"type": "lab_options", "contents": [{"content": true, "type": "has_nav"}, {"content": true, "type": "has_exercise_controls"}]}], "type": "scholar", "stimuli": [{"_data": [], "type": "welcome", "contents": [{}], "template_override": 1, "id": 0}, {"id": 1, "title": "", "contents": [{"value": {"images": [{"text": "", "id": 0, "time": "0", "image": "frn5le11ob03re2img01.jpg"}, {"text": "<span class=\"strong\">Pierre</span> : Charlotte, est-ce que tu as eu des nouvelles d'Ici et Ailleurs ?</br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Charlotte</span> : Oui !</br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Pierre</span> : Et alors ?</br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Charlotte</span> : Tu as devant toi la nouvelle journaliste ind\u00e9pendante d'Ici et Ailleurs.</br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Pierre</span> : Oh l\u00e0 l\u00e0 ! Tu pourras mettre \u00e7a sur ta carte de visite : Charlotte Pasquier, journaliste freelance. </br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Charlotte</span> : Oui. D'ailleurs, il faudrait que je la mette \u00e0 jour.", "id": 1, "time": "100", "image": "frn5le11ob03re2img01.jpg"}, {"text": "<span class=\"strong\">Pierre</span> : Quand est-ce que tu commences ? De quoi parlera ton premier article ?</br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Charlotte</span> : Il est probable que je commence jeudi.</br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Pierre</span> : Super. Ce ne sera pas de tout repos au d\u00e9but, j'imagine.</br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Charlotte</span> : Pas vraiment, non. Je crains que les premi\u00e8res semaines soient stressantes.</br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Pierre</span> : C'est possible, mais je pense que c'est une super occasion pour toi. En plus, je pourrai me vanter de conna\u00eetre quelqu'un qui travaille pour un magazine de renom !", "id": 2, "time": "15700", "image": "frn5le11ob03re2img01.jpg"}, {"text": "<span class=\"strong\">Charlotte</span> : Pierre, je ne suis qu'une pigiste pour le moment. Je ne pense pas qu'il y ait de quoi se vanter.</br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Pierre</span> : Tu pourrais devenir r\u00e9dactrice-en-chef un jour, qui sait !</br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Charlotte</span> : On peut toujours r\u00eaver...</br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Pierre</span> : En tout cas, est-ce qu'on verra ton nom dans les titres ?</br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Charlotte</span> : Pierre, quand on travaille pour un magazine, il est normal que son nom paraisse dans les titres\u2026", "id": 3, "time": "36200", "image": "frn5le11ob03re2img02.jpg"}], "audiosrc": "frn5le11ob03re2aud01", "coverimg": "frn5le11ob03re2img01.jpg"}, "type": "slideshow"}], "_data": [], "type": "audio", "template_override": 1}, {"id": 4, "title": "", "contents": [{"value": "<span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: So, Sally, did you hear from Cambridge Life?<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: I did!<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: And?<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: I believe that you're speaking to Cambridge Life's newest freelancer.<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: Well, well. You're now Ms. Sally Davis, the freelance journalist then?<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: That'd be correct.<br><br>\n\n<span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: When do you start? What will you do?<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: I might start as early as Thursday.<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: That's great. Sounds like you're going to have to put in a lot of hours.<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: I know. I'm going to be super nervous.<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: Yeah but personally, I think it's pretty exciting. Now, I can say I know someone who works for a magazine. I'll brag about you to everyone I know.<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: Peter, it's just a freelance position. Nothing worth bragging about.<br><br>\n\n<span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: You might become a managing editor one day!<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: It will be a long way to go before I get to a position like that.<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: Wait, so, does this mean your name is going to be on the masthead?<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: Well, Peter. That is the general consensus when you work for a magazine.", "type": "p"}], "_data": [], "type": "text", "template_override": 1}], "exercises": [{"id": 0, "stimuli_ids": [0], "questions": [], "_data": [{"type": "instructions", "contents": [{"content": "Je peux d\u00e9crire des possibilit\u00e9s futures et poser des questions l\u00e0-dessus.", "type": "Learning Outcomes"}, {"content": "Je peux parler des m\u00e9tiers et du travail.", "type": "Learning Outcomes"}, {"content": "Je peux donner des opinions.", "type": "Learning Outcomes"}, {"content": "Travaillez-vous en ce moment&nbsp;? Si oui, que faites-vous&nbsp;?", "type": "Free Header Item"}, {"content": "\u00c9tiez-vous nerveux ou nerveuse quand vous avez commenc\u00e9&nbsp;?", "type": "Free Header Item"}, {"content": "Si vous ne travaillez pas pour le moment, y a-t-il une situation qui vous donne le trac&nbsp;? Laquelle&nbsp;?", "type": "Free Header Item"}]}, {"type": "group", "contents": [{"content": "Welcome", "type": "group_name"}]}, {"content": {"correct_feedback": "Correct", "allowed_attempts": 2, "attempt_feedback": [{"content": "You have 2 tries", "type": "text"}, {"content": "you have 1 attempt left", "type": "text"}], "incorrect_feedback": [{"content": "try again", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Maybe next time", "type": "text"}]}, "type": "feedback"}, {"content": "Demandez \u00e0 votre camarade :", "type": "free_header_text"}, {"content": "Premier jour au boulot bient\u00f4t&nbsp;! Pas de trac&nbsp;? Pas de probl\u00e8me&nbsp;!", "type": "free_type_text_area"}], "img_path": "", "type": "WLC", "template_override": 1}, {"id": 1, "stimuli_ids": [1], "questions": [{"_data": [{"type": "question", "contents": [{"content": "", "type": "text"}]}], "responses": [{"id": 0, "_data": [{"content": "", "type": "text"}], "selected": 0, "correct": 0}, {"id": 1, 